    "prompt": "[Intro - no vocal and dry guitar chord strums only]\n[played entirely with dry guitar chords only]\n\n[verse 1 - guitar chord strums only]]\nI circle where the plastic reeds lean\nPast one grey stone and back again\nA face beyond the wall makes shapes\nYet never recognises name\n\nDead water keeps a bitter taste\nOf things that would not move\nI draw it through my narrow gills\nAnd call the ache a life\n\n[pre-chorus - dry guitar chord strums only]\nAt feeding time, a hand arrives\nThen leaves the pane unchanged\n\n[chorus - dry guitar chord strums only]\nBehind the glass, I am a fish\nAlive where nothing flows\nA beautiful machine of need\nFor eyes that never know\nThe world forgets I have a pulse\nYou forget I am here\nLight thins me into water\nUntil I disappear\n\n[played entirely with dry guitar chords only]\n\n[verse 2 - dry guitar chord strums only]\nThey keep me for the colour I make\nAgainst the deadened green\nBeneath the watching room, I turn\nAnd leave no mark behind\n\nUse has rubbed my scales away\nUntil they nearly clear\nAround these bones, no story forms\nNo witness stays to speak\n\n[pre-chorus - dry guitar chord strums only]\nSomeone changes out the tank\nAnd takes the former water down\n\n[chorus - dry guitar chord strums only]\nClean water climbs the empty frame\nNo shadow in its place\nThat old blue world runs down a drain\nWithout a single trace\nWhat seeped into the sleeping ground\nWhat lifted into sky\nCannot become a current\nOr find a place to lie\n\n[played entirely with dry guitar chords only]\n\n[bridge - guitar chord strums only]\nBeyond the wall, a larger sea\nMay close above its own\nThis clear wall has become a sky\nNo wing can travel through\n\n[final chorus - dry guitar chord strums only]\nEvery passing face looks through me\nAir keeps my silence whole\nMemory leaves no chair for me\nMy soul has nowhere to go\nThe tank can shine as if untouched\nOnce all the water clears\nBut somewhere past the emptied glass\nA vanished spirit veers\n\n[outro - dry guitar chord strums only]\nThe room stays bright\nThe water moves\nNothing remembers nothing\n\n[end - no vocal and dry guitar chord strums only]",
