    "prompt": "\n “Right Outside”\n\n---\n\n[Verse 1]\n\nWoke up with that voice in my head again,\nSayin’, “You too close to quit right now.”\nBeen dreamin’ with my back against the wind,\nFeelin’ like the world don’t hear me out.\n\nEvery step I take, I feel that pull,\nBetween safe and what’s possible.\nFear call my name, but I can’t stay,\nGot too much fire to fade away.\n\n\n---\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n\nNo reward where the lines too clear,\nYou gotta move through the unknown, dear.\nChange ain’t comfy, but it’s true,\nThat’s where the best of life finds you.\n\n\n---\n\n[Chorus – Catchy & Smooth]\n\nRight outside your peace of mind,\nThat’s where the stars align.\nYou can’t grow if you don’t climb,\nThe edge is where you’ll find your shine.\n\nRight outside what feels so safe,\nThere’s a better you to chase.\nEvery dream, every sign,\nLives right outside your comfort line.\n\n\n---\n\n[Verse 2]\n\nI’ve been learnin’ how to trust the fall,\nHow to lose control and still stand tall.\nYou can’t script the life you’re owed,\nYou gotta walk it, heart and soul.\n\nNo shortcuts on this road to gold,\nNo dream comes dressed in folds.\nEvery risk I take remind me why,\nI’d rather fail than never try.\n\n\n---\n\n[Bridge – Falsetto Layer / Guitar Riff]\n\n(soft falsetto humming under)\nMmm, yeah… step through the fear,\nThe freedom’s near.\nYou’re one choice away,\nFrom your breakthrough day.\n\n(ad-libs)\nDon’t freeze now, just move now,\nWhat you want’s right past that doubt.\n\n\n---\n\n[Final Chorus – Full Harmonies & Vibe]\n\nRight outside your peace of mind,\nThat’s where the stars align.\nYou can’t grow if you don’t climb,\nThe edge is where you’ll find your shine.\n\nRight outside what feels so safe,\nThere’s a better you to chase.\nDon’t stay where dreams can’t rise,\nYour future waits right outside.\n\n\n---\n\n[Outro – Spoken Fade]\n\nComfort is cool…\nBut growth — that’s divine.\nIf it scares you, it’s a sign.\nStep out… you’re closer than you think.\nDreamrz Life.\n\n\n---\n\n",
